        <div
            class="wikigg-showcase__unit wikigg-showcase__reserved--lb"
            data-wgg-unit-type="internal"
        ></div>
</aside>

		<div class="content-body">
			<main>
				<a id="top"></a>
				<div id="siteNotice"></div>
				<div class="mw-indicators">
				</div>
				<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Slime Boss</span></h1>
				<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
					<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From Slay the Spire Wiki</div>
					<div id="contentSub"></div>
					<div id="contentSub2"></div>
					
					<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
					<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-enemy-infobox" id="druid-container-1"><div><div class="druid-title">Slime Boss</div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-main-image"><a href="/wiki/File:SlimeBoss.png" class="image"><img alt="SlimeBoss.png" src="/images/SlimeBoss.png?bab55d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="508" height="394" data-file-width="508" data-file-height="394" /></a></div></div><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-HP" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-HP">HP</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-HP druid-data-nonempty">
140<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="9" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><br />150</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">9</span></sup></span></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Debut" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-Debut">Debut</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-Debut druid-data-nonempty">
<a href="/wiki/Act_1" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 1">Act 1</a></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Powers" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-Powers">Powers</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-Powers druid-data-nonempty">
<span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Split" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Split.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Split.png/22px-Icon_Split.png?d6f1b4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Split.png/33px-Icon_Split.png?d6f1b4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Split.png/44px-Icon_Split.png?d6f1b4 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffs#Split" title="Buffs">Split</a></span></div></div></div></div> <div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-small" id="druid-container-2"><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Title" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Title druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Split.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Split.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Split.png/30px-Icon_Split.png?d6f1b4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Split.png/45px-Icon_Split.png?d6f1b4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Split.png/60px-Icon_Split.png?d6f1b4 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> Split<div class="infobox-edit-button"><a href="/wiki/Module:Powers/data" title="Module:Powers/data"><img alt="ModuleEditIcon.png" src="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/28px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" srcset="/images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/42px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 1.5x, /images/thumb/ModuleEditIcon.png/56px-ModuleEditIcon.png?d0f77e 2x" data-file-width="202" data-file-height="202" /></a></div></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-StackType" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-label druid-label-StackType">Stack Type</div><div class="druid-data druid-data-StackType druid-data-nonempty">
Does not stack</div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Text" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Text druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
When its HP is at or below 50%, it will split into 2 smaller Slimes with its current HP.</div></div></div></div>
<div class="druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt druid-container-small" id="druid-container-3"><div class="druid-section-container"><div class="druid-row druid-row-Title" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Title druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed">Slimed</a></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Summary" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Summary druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
1 Energy - <span class="plainlink" data-name="Cards"><a class="text" href="https://slaythespire.wiki.gg/wiki/Slay_the_Spire_2:Cards_List?type=Status"><span class="none">Status</span></a></span></div></div><div class="druid-row druid-row-Text" data-druid-section-row="Main"><div class="druid-data druid-data-Text druid-data-nonempty druid-data-wide">
<span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Exhaust" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Exhaust" title="Keywords">Exhaust</a></span>.</div></div></div></div>
<p><b>Slime Boss</b> is a <a href="/wiki/Boss" class="mw-redirect" title="Boss">Boss</a> that can appear at the end of <a href="/wiki/Act_1" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 1">Act 1</a> or the <a href="/wiki/Act_3" class="mw-redirect" title="Act 3">Act 3</a> event <span class="event-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mind Bloom" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Mind_Bloom" title="Mind Bloom"><img alt="EventClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/20px-EventClear.png?8b40cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EventClear.png/30px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EventClear.png/40px-EventClear.png?8b40cd 2x" data-file-width="74" data-file-height="74" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Mind_Bloom" title="Mind Bloom">Mind Bloom</a></span>.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Pattern">Pattern</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss?veaction=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Pattern" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss?action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Pattern"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<table class="wikitable">
<caption>
</caption>
<tbody><tr>
<th>Name
</th>
<th>Intent
</th>
<th>Effect
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan="2"><b>Goop Spray</b>
</td>
<td rowspan="2" style="text-align:center;"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_DebuffStrong.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent DebuffStrong.png" src="/images/Intent_DebuffStrong.png?c3a322" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a>
</td>
<td>Adds 3 <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slimed" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed">Slimed</a></span> into your discard pile.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Adds <span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="19" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">5</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">19</span></sup></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slimed" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed">Slimed</a></span> into your discard pile.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan="1"><b>Preparing</b>
</td>
<td rowspan="1" style="text-align:center;"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a>
</td>
<td>Does nothing.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan="2"><b>Slam</b>
</td>
<td rowspan="2" style="text-align:center;"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Attack7.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Attack7.png" src="/images/Intent_Attack7.png?828495" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a>
</td>
<td>Deals 35 damage.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Deals <span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="4" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">38</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">4</span></sup></span> damage.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td rowspan="1"><b>Split</b>
</td>
<td rowspan="1" style="text-align:center;"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a>
</td>
<td>Disappears and spawns 1 <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Acid Slime (L)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slimes#Acid_Slime_(L)" title="Slimes"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimes#Acid_Slime_(L)" title="Slimes">Acid Slime (L)</a></span> and 1 <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spike Slime (L)" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slimes#Spike_Slime_(L)" title="Slimes"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimes#Spike_Slime_(L)" title="Slimes">Spike Slime (L)</a></span> with its current HP.
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Repeats the following pattern:
</p>
<ol><li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Goop Spray" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_DebuffStrong.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent DebuffStrong.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_DebuffStrong.png/22px-Intent_DebuffStrong.png?c3a322" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_DebuffStrong.png/33px-Intent_DebuffStrong.png?c3a322 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_DebuffStrong.png/44px-Intent_DebuffStrong.png?c3a322 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Goop Spray</a></span></li>
<li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Preparing" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Preparing</a></span></li>
<li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Slam" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Attack7.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Attack7.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/22px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/33px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/44px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slam</a></span></li></ol>
<p>Once its HP reaches 50% or lower, its current <a href="/wiki/Intent" title="Intent">Intent</a> will be immediately changed to <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Split</a></span>.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Hints">Hints</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss?veaction=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Hints" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss?action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Hints"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li>Until <b>Slime Boss</b> <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">splits</a></span>, <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Slam" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Attack7.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Attack7.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/22px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/33px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/44px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slam</a></span> is the only way it can harm you. Other than this attack, it spends most of the fight doing nothing. There are many ways to deal with it other than with <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> and <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Weak" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak"><img alt="Icon Weak.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/22px-Icon_Weak.png?261352" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/33px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Weak.png/44px-Icon_Weak.png?261352 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Weak" title="Weak">Weak</a></span>:
<ul><li>As long as you can deal 70 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="9" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">75</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">9</span></sup></span>) damage by turn 3, you can force <b>Slime Boss</b> to <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">split</a></span> before it attacks.</li>
<li>You may fully negate <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Slam" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Attack7.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Attack7.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/22px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/33px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Attack7.png/44px-Intent_Attack7.png?828495 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Slam</a></span> with <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Buffer" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffer" title="Buffer"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png?a9e6d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png?a9e6d3 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffer" title="Buffer">Buffer</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fossilized Helix" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fossilized_Helix" title="Fossilized Helix"><img alt="FossilizedHelix.png" src="/images/thumb/FossilizedHelix.png/24px-FossilizedHelix.png?3b5217" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FossilizedHelix.png/36px-FossilizedHelix.png?3b5217 1.5x, /images/thumb/FossilizedHelix.png/48px-FossilizedHelix.png?3b5217 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fossilized_Helix" title="Fossilized Helix">Fossilized Helix</a></span>, <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Incense Burner" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Incense_Burner" title="Incense Burner"><img alt="IncenseBurner.png" src="/images/thumb/IncenseBurner.png/24px-IncenseBurner.png?1350c5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/IncenseBurner.png/36px-IncenseBurner.png?1350c5 1.5x, /images/thumb/IncenseBurner.png/48px-IncenseBurner.png?1350c5 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Incense_Burner" title="Incense Burner">Incense Burner</a></span> and <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Ghost in a Jar" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:GhostinaJar.png" class="image"><img alt="GhostinaJar.png" src="/images/thumb/GhostinaJar.png/24px-GhostinaJar.png?b73f87" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GhostinaJar.png/36px-GhostinaJar.png?b73f87 1.5x, /images/thumb/GhostinaJar.png/48px-GhostinaJar.png?b73f87 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Ghost_in_a_Jar" title="Ghost in a Jar">Ghost in a Jar</a></span>.</li>
<li>Rest before the fight to have more than 35 (<span class="inline-trigger ascension-trigger" data-name="4" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">38</a><sup><a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension"><img alt="Ascension.png" src="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/18px-Ascension.png?bb884e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Ascension.png/27px-Ascension.png?bb884e 1.5x, /images/thumb/Ascension.png/36px-Ascension.png?bb884e 2x" data-file-width="43" data-file-height="43" /></a> <span class="ascension-superscript">4</span></sup></span>) HP, then simply tank it. After all, you always heal after boss fights.</li></ul></li>
<li><span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Split</a></span> creates two <a href="/wiki/Slimes" title="Slimes">Large Slimes</a> with <b>Slime Boss'</b> remaining HP. Thus it's better to cause <b>Slime Boss</b> to lose as much health as possible before the <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">splitting</a></span>.
<ul><li>This can be done by bringing the boss as close as possible to half HP, then applying <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vulnerable" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable"><img alt="Icon Vulnerable.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/22px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/33px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Vulnerable.png/44px-Icon_Vulnerable.png?8c74cd 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vulnerable" title="Vulnerable">Vulnerable</a></span> and spending as much energy as possible playing Attacks.</li>
<li>With <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Wrath" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Wrath</a></span>, the <a href="/wiki/Watcher" title="Watcher">Watcher</a> is particularly good at killing or nearly killing <b>Slime Boss</b> before it can <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">split</a></span>.</li></ul></li>
<li><b>Slime Boss</b> and its <a href="/wiki/Slimes" title="Slimes">Slimes</a> will clog your Deck with <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slimed" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed">Slimed</a></span> the longer the fight goes on, particularly harshly on higher <a href="/wiki/Ascension" title="Ascension">ascensions</a>.
<ul><li><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Evolve" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve">Evolve</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fire Breathing" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Fire_Breathing" title="Fire Breathing">Fire Breathing</a></span> turn those <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slimed" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed"><img alt="CardIcon Status.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Status.png/24px-CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Status.png?5935a6 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Slimed" title="Slimed">Slimed</a></span> into advantage.</li></ul></li>
<li>Sources of AOE damage like <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Whirlwind" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Whirlwind" title="Whirlwind"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Attack Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Attack_Uncommon.png?d4e46d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Whirlwind" title="Whirlwind">Whirlwind</a></span> are effective against the <a href="/wiki/Slimes" title="Slimes">Slimes</a> that spawn after <b>Slime Boss</b> <span class="intent-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Slime Boss#Split" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:Intent_Unknown.png" class="image"><img alt="Intent Unknown.png" src="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/22px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/33px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Intent_Unknown.png/44px-Intent_Unknown.png?ef3f5c 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink selflink">Splits</a></span>.</li></ul>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Trivia">Trivia</span><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss?veaction=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Trivia" class="mw-editsection-visualeditor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-divider"> | </span><a href="/wiki/Slime_Boss?action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia"><span>edit source</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></h2>
<ul><li><b>Slime Boss</b> appears in the artwork of <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Evolve" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Uncommon.png?4df1e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Evolve" title="Evolve">Evolve</a></span> and <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Grand Finale" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Grand_Finale" title="Grand Finale"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Rare.png?c4cf3b" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Rare.png?c4cf3b 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Grand_Finale" title="Grand Finale">Grand Finale</a></span>.</li></ul>
<p><br />
</p>
