<li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Fungi Beast" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Fungi_Beast#Fungi_Beast" title="Fungi Beast">Fungi Beast</a></span></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Thieves" title="Thieves">Thieves</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Sentry" title="Sentry">Sentry</a></li>
