<ul><li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Book of Stabbing" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Book_of_Stabbing#Book_of_Stabbing" title="Book of Stabbing">Book of Stabbing</a></span></li>
