<ul><li><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Bronze Automaton" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Bronze_Automaton#Bronze_Automaton" title="Bronze Automaton">Bronze Automaton</a></span></li>
